@startuml 员工签到顺序图
title 图3-1 员工签到用例顺序图（与系统代码一致）

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "员工" as User
participant "签到界面\n(yuangongqiandao/list.vue)" as UI
participant "签到控制器\n(YuangongqiandaoController)" as Ctrl
participant "签到服务\n(YuangongqiandaoService)" as Svc
database "数据库\n(yuangongqiandao 表)" as DB

== 阶段一：加载页面 ==
User -> UI   : 1. 打开"员工签到"页面
UI   -> Ctrl : 2. GET /yuangongqiandao/page
Ctrl -> Svc  : 3. queryPage(params)
Svc  -> DB   : 4. SELECT * FROM yuangongqiandao
DB   --> Svc : 5. 历史签到记录
Svc  --> Ctrl: 6. PageUtils
Ctrl --> UI  : 7. {code:0, data:[...]}
UI   --> User: 8. 渲染列表 + 月历

== 阶段二：打卡 ==
User -> UI   : 9. 点击[签到/签退/加班开始/加班结束]
note right of UI
  10. 前端本地处理：
  - canQuickSign() 按钮状态校验
  - new Date() 取当前时间
  - 从 session 取 gonghao / 姓名 / 头像
end note
UI   -> Ctrl : 11. POST /yuangongqiandao/save\n{gonghao, qiandaoshijian, qiandaodidian, ...}
Ctrl -> Svc  : 12. save(entity)
Svc  -> DB   : 13. INSERT INTO yuangongqiandao
DB   --> Svc : 14. affectedRows = 1
Svc  --> Ctrl: 15. true
Ctrl --> UI  : 16. {code:0}
UI   --> User: 17. 显示"XX 已记录" + 刷新列表/日历

@enduml
